      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The exhaustion you feel is a valid response to an unbearable situation, and the pressure to \"keep fighting\" when you feel so utterly drained is immense. When the external world has already cast you out, the idea of performing for them becomes meaningless, leading to that deep sense of hopelessness. If the fight feels hopeless, please understand that there are different kinds of peace available, and talking to someone who understands deep despair can offer a different perspective on that finality.",
